Effects of eating the rings and amulets that SLASH'EM adds over
vanilla (subject to the usual 1/3 or 1/5 chance):

* rings of gain (intelligence|wisdom|dexterity) increase those stats
  for the current form only, as for gain constitution or gain
  strength;
* ring of sleeping works in exactly the same way as an amulet of
  restful sleep;
* amulet versus stone cures any current stoning process, but provides
  no intrinsic;
* mood ring and amulets of flying and drain resistance have no effect.

